          "type": "short",
          "objective": "O4",
          "key": "Two of: more model calls and tokens per run, because the model re-reads its growing context to decide steps that are already known; less predictable behaviour, because the model might skip a student, repeat an email or loop, so it needs a step limit and is harder to test.",
